# Kuya Kap - Unified Social Visit & Tambayan Smalltalk Timeline
# Voice: Homey Filipino elderly tito. Zero time-of-day markers. Zero em-dashes.

label Greeting
if {Transaction_HasReactiveOpener}:
	KuyaKap: {Transaction_ReactiveOpener}
if {Transaction_VisitVar} < 34:
	KuyaKap: Relax, apo, not buying anything. Just stretching my old back across the road.
	KuyaKap: Kumain ka na ba? Don't skip meals just because the counter gets busy.
elif {Transaction_VisitVar} < 67:
	KuyaKap: Breeze is nicer under your awning than under my tree right now.
	KuyaKap: Your Lola used to keep a small electric fan right by that register. Smart woman.
else:
	KuyaKap: Just checking in on you, nak. Tricycle drivers down the road say you run a fair counter.
	KuyaKap: Keep that up. Good word travels fast in Karimlan.
[signal arg="story_success"]
[end_timeline]

label Smalltalk
if {Transaction_VisitVar} < 34:
	KuyaKap: Alright, knees are awake again. Back to my post, apo.
elif {Transaction_VisitVar} < 67:
	KuyaKap: Good breather. Keep an eye on those candy jars when Buboy runs past, ha.
else:
	KuyaKap: Sige, nak, back to the acacia. Just wave if you need a hand.
[end_timeline]
